Ularn 1.6.3a should contain the following files:

Filename                Description
--------                -----------
README                  it's the readme (original Readme.txt below a short preface)
README.spoilers         spoiler guide from Phil Cordier's web site
README.amiga            notes for the Amiga version
INSTALL                 build and installation instructions
CHANGES.text            version history
MANIFEST                this list
LICENSE                 GNU General Public License, version 2
COPYRIGHT               authorship, and which modules are NOT GPL
BSDLicense.txt          BSD license template, as shipped in the distribution
Makefile                runs the TTY or X11 build in src/

data/                   run-time files, installed into LIBDIR
  Uhelp                 help file
  Umaps                 predefined dungeon maps
  Ufortune              fortune cookie messages
  Uscore                scoreboard
  ularn_gfx.xpm         tile graphics, X11 version
  ularn_gfx.bmp         tile graphics, Windows version
  Ularn_gfx.iff         tile graphics, Amiga version
  gfx_guide.txt         index of the tiles in the graphics files

src/                    game source
  ularn.c               main module: setup and main processing loop
  ularn_game.c/.h       game data and options file handling
  ularn_ask.c/.h        common prompts (yes/no, direction, etc.)
  action.c/.h           player actions
  diag.c/.h             diagnostic dump
  dungeon.c/.h          dungeon levels
  dungeon_obj.c/.h      static dungeon objects (altars, thrones, fountains...)
  fortune.c/.h          fortune cookies
  getopt.c/.h           command line option processing
  header.h              common macros
  help.c/.h             help file and welcome screen
  itm.c/.h              item definitions and names
  monster.c/.h          monsters
  object.c/.h           what the player finds when moving onto a square
  patchlevel.h          version and patch level
  player.c/.h           the player
  potion.c/.h           potions
  savegame.c/.h         save and restore
  saveutils.c/.h        save file utilities
  scores.c/.h           scoreboard
  scroll.c/.h           scrolls and books
  show.c/.h             item names and inventory lists
  spell.c/.h            spells
  sphere.c/.h           spheres of annihilation
  store.c/.h            the home level: DND store, bank, college, LRS, etc.
  config.h              build selection (UNIX_TTY, UNIX_X11, WINDOWS,
                        W32_TTY, AMIGA_WIN) and LIBDIR

  Front ends (all OS dependent input and display code; one is linked)
  ularn_win.h           interface every front end implements
  ularn_wintty.c        curses version (Unix TTY, Win32 TTY with pdcurses)
  ularn_winx11.c        X11 version
  x11_simple_menu.c/.h  X11 menu library (not GPL, see COPYRIGHT)
  ularn_win.c           Windows 32 graphical version
  ularn_private.h       Dev-C++ resource header
  Ularn_winami.c        Amiga (AGA) version
  Smart_menu.c/.h       Amiga Intuition menu helper (not GPL)
  ifftools.c/.h         Amiga IFF ILBM reader (not GPL)
  bio.c/.h              Amiga buffered I/O (not GPL)

  Build files
  makefile.tty          Unix TTY (gcc, curses)
  makefile.x11          Unix X11 (gcc, Xlib, Xpm)
  makefile.mgwtty       Win32 TTY (MinGW)
  Makefile.mingw        Win32 graphical (MinGW)
  Makefile.win          Win32 graphical (Dev-C++ generated)
  ularn.dev             Dev-C++ project
  makefile.bcc          Win32 graphical (Borland C++ 5.5)
  makefile.bcctty       Win32 TTY (Borland C++ 5.5, pdcurses)
  ularn.rsp             Borland linker response file, graphical
  ularntty.rsp          Borland linker response file, TTY
  ularn.def             Borland module definition file
  ularnpc.ide           Borland IDE project
  ularnpc.rc/.rh/.RES   Windows resources (Borland)
  ularn_private.rc/.res Windows resources (Dev-C++/MinGW)
  ularn.ico             Windows icon
  makefile.ami          Amiga (SAS/C 6.51)
  ularn.info            Amiga Workbench icon
  checkmark.bm          Amiga menu checkmark bitmap
  cursor.bm             Amiga cursor bitmap

  Not built (left as shipped in the 1.6.3a distribution)
  ularn_orig.c          earlier version of ularn.c
  ularn_integ.c         Windows integration test main
  ularn_main.c          front end smoke test main
  test.c                curses colour test
  comment_templates.c   comment block templates used by the author
  bill.c                "mail on winning" letters from 1.5 (feature removed)
  extern.h              old global header from 1.5 (bill.c only)
